CORE PRINCIPLES
====================================================================

1. SDK MUST NOT slow customer applications.

2. SDK MUST NOT consume excessive memory.

3. SDK MUST NEVER block business transactions.

4. SDK MUST work automatically after dependency installation.

5. SDK MUST require almost zero code changes.

6. Customer business data must remain separate from audit data.

7. Storage must be pluggable.

8. Architecture must support future cloud migration.

9. Database-specific logic must be minimized.

10. Framework abstraction must be prioritized over database abstraction.

